# ---------------authentication---------------------------------------------------

### Admin Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "armsbctls@gmail.com",
  "password": "password"
}
### Get new Access Token using Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": ""
}

###forgot password/Send OTP to email

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/forgot-password/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "armsbctls@gmail.com"
}
### Verify OTP sent to email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/verify-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "armsbctls@gmail.com",
  "otp": "64591"
}
### Reset password after OTP verification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/reset-password/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "armsbctls@gmail.com",
  "new_password": "password123"
}
