###-----------------------review -------------------------

### List all reviews for a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/25a6e9bd-7cd5-465c-91b5-c86f8915f236/reviews/
Accept: application/json

### Add a review to a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/25a6e9bd-7cd5-465c-91b5-c86f8915f236/reviews/add/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ann",
  "email": "johnann@example.com",
  "rating": 2,
  "review": "OK, highly recommend!"
}
